If you don't want to be spoiled, take notes. Take notes for
each character and notes for general observations. I use
notepad but even paper notes will work. Make it your goal to
reach the Oracle with each character and buy all the major
consultations you can afford each game. Cut and paste (it's
pretty important to copy word for word, paraphrasing is a
bad idea) the results into your general notes file and go
back and read them from time to time.

Make sure you know and try all the commands. When you give a
command look at the choices you are offered. You might think
of some new things to try. Use the / command a lot.

If you don't mind being spoiled, read the spoilers Jukka
suggested and ask questions here (preferably in that order).

